{
  "name": "Daily Report Reminder Workflow",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "type": "hours",
              "value": 24
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "1",
      "name": "Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.cron",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        250,
        300
      ],
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Triggers daily at configured time"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "recordTable",
        "operation": "read",
        "baseId": "{{ $env.SUPABASE_URL }}",
        "tableName": "shift_settings",
        "filterType": "manual",
        "filterByTables": {}
      },
      "id": "2",
      "name": "Get Shift Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        500,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": "Supabase"
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "recordTable",
        "operation": "read",
        "baseId": "{{ $env.SUPABASE_URL }}",
        "tableName": "recipients",
        "filterType": "manual",
        "filterByTables": {
          "user_id": "{{ $node[\"Get Shift Settings\"].json.user_id }}",
          "whatsapp_enabled": true
        }
      },
      "id": "3",
      "name": "Get Recipients",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        750,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": "Supabase"
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "functionCode": "const recipients = $input.all();\nconst messages = recipients.map(r => ({\n  name: r.json.name,\n  phone: r.json.phone_number,\n  message: `⏰ Daily Report Reminder\\n\\nHi ${r.json.name},\\n\\nIt's time to submit your daily report before shift ends!\\n\\nPlease log in and submit your report now.`\n}));\nreturn messages;"
      },
      "id": "4",
      "name": "Format Messages",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1000,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "toNumber": "={{ $node[\"Format Messages\"].json.phone }}",
        "messageText": "={{ $node[\"Format Messages\"].json.message }}"
      },
      "id": "5",
      "name": "Send WhatsApp via Twilio",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.twilio",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1250,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "twilioApi": "Twilio"
      },
      "description": "Sends WhatsApp message to each recipient"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "recordTable",
        "operation": "create",
        "baseId": "{{ $env.SUPABASE_URL }}",
        "tableName": "report_reminders",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            {
              "fieldId": "user_id",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $node[\"Get Shift Settings\"].json.user_id }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "scheduled_time",
              "fieldValue": "={{ new Date().toISOString() }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "sent_at",
              "fieldValue": "={{ new Date().toISOString() }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "status",
              "fieldValue": "sent"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "6",
      "name": "Log Reminder Sent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1500,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": "Supabase"
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "7",
      "name": "Error Handler",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.errorTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1250,
        500
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "channel": "{{ $env.SLACK_CHANNEL }}",
        "text": "❌ Daily Report Reminder Failed\\n\\nError: {{ $node[\"Error Handler\"].json.errorMessage }}"
      },
      "id": "8",
      "name": "Slack Notification",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1500,
        500
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": "Slack"
      },
      "onError": "continueErrorHandling"
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Schedule Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Get Shift Settings",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Get Shift Settings": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Get Recipients",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Get Recipients": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Format Messages",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Format Messages": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send WhatsApp via Twilio",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Send WhatsApp via Twilio": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Log Reminder Sent",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "notes": "Daily Report Reminder Workflow\n\nThis n8n workflow automates sending daily report reminders via WhatsApp.\n\nFlow:\n1. Cron trigger fires daily at scheduled time\n2. Fetch all shift settings from Supabase\n3. Get recipients for that user (filtered by whatsapp_enabled=true)\n4. Format reminder messages for each recipient\n5. Send WhatsApp messages via Twilio\n6. Log reminder sent status in database\n7. On error, notify via Slack\n\nSetup Instructions:\n- Create Supabase, Twilio, and Slack credentials in n8n\n- Set environment variables: SUPABASE_URL, TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID, SLACK_CHANNEL\n- Deploy to n8n Cloud or self-hosted instance\n- Activate the workflow"
}
